  "title": "Overnight-Marinated Flank Steak",
  "description": "This recipe makes a quick and easy overnight marinade for a grilled flank steak.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan P"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-07-10T03:04:19-04:00",
